    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Would you mind elaborating on what do you mean by \"remapping leader key\"? What setup do you have with respect to 'mini.basics' and leader key?\r\n\r\nSetting leader key is essentially setting the `vim.g.mapleader` global variable. The 'mini.basics' [does not override if it is set](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c122e852517adaf7257688e435369c050da113b1/lua/mini/basics.lua#L433-L435).\r\n\r\nAlso, make sure that all your leader mappings are [done after setting the leader key](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c122e852517adaf7257688e435369c050da113b1/doc/mini-basics.txt#L144-L145).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Would you mind elaborating on what do you mean by \"remapping leader key\"? What setup do you have with respect to 'mini.basics' and leader key?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Setting leader key is essentially setting the <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.g.mapleader</code> global variable. The 'mini.basics' <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c122e852517adaf7257688e435369c050da113b1/lua/mini/basics.lua#L433-L435\">does not override if it is set</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also, make sure that all your leader mappings are <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c122e852517adaf7257688e435369c050da113b1/doc/mini-basics.txt#L144-L145\">done after setting the leader key</a>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Would you mind elaborating on what do you mean by \"remapping leader key\"? What setup do you have with respect to 'mini.basics' and leader key?\nSetting leader key is essentially setting the vim.g.mapleader global variable. The 'mini.basics' does not override if it is set.\nAlso, make sure that all your leader mappings are done after setting the leader key.",
